Risk Factor Summary
Our business is subject to numerous risks and uncertainties,including those described in Item 1 A“Risk
Factors.”These risks include,but are not limited to,thefollowing:
• Our financial condition and results of operations for fiscal 2022 may continue to be adversely affected
bytheCOVID-19pandemic;
